type chatChain struct {
	index int
	next *chatChain
	pre *chatChain
	dialog_content *chatlist
	abstract string
}


围绕这个双向链表结构的会话管理，主要需要以下几个核心操作函数：

### 链表基础节点操作

* `NewChatChain(index int) *chatChain`
* `AppendNode(head *chatChain, data *chatlist) *chatChain`
* `InsertNodeAfter(target *chatChain, data *chatlist) *chatChain`
* `DeleteNode(node *chatChain) *chatChain`
* `GetNodeByIndex(head *chatChain, index int) *chatChain`

---

### 会话与摘要管理

* `GenerateAbstract(data *chatlist) string`
* `UpdateAbstract(node *chatChain, abstract string)`
* `GetHistoryList(head *chatChain) []map[string]interface{}`

---

### 数据持久化与恢复

* `SaveChainToFile(head *chatChain, filePath string) error`
* `LoadChainFromFile(filePath string) (*chatChain, error)`